# The 24 kHz masters. ~200 MB, and they exist only so a different delivery profile can be
# re-derived without re-spending TTS calls. The delivered 8 kHz audio/ IS committed --
# that is the eval set, and freezing it is what makes an arm-to-arm comparison meaningful.
masters/

# TTS response cache, keyed by sha256(text|voice|rate|pitch). Regenerable, and large.
cache/

# Model outputs under test. Never commit an arm's transcripts: they are model output over
# audio, the same class of artifact the repo-root .gitignore keeps out of git for out/.
hypotheses/

# Generated plots and reports are re-derivable from the committed audio in one command.
reports/plots/
